{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_40_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_40","textTraditional":"○歷七","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_40_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_40","textTraditional":"△立成","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_40_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_40","textTraditional":"至元十九年，郭守敬以《授時歷》雖頒行，然立成之數尚無定稿，乃比類編次，整齊分秒，裁為二卷。《明志》據監本題：太史令臣王恂奉敕撰，謂恂之稿本，守敬卒成之。監本久軼，然《明志》所載《大統通軌》之立成，則出於守敬原書無疑也。今采附《歷經》之後，以備步七政盈縮遲疾者之用焉。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_40_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_40","textTraditional":"太陽盈初縮未限立成（冬至前後二象限同用）","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_40_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_40","textTraditional":"（表略）","sentenceOrder":5}],"overrides":{}}